  <entity00149655:ExplanationOfRedevelopmentAndReconstructionAssociationsBusinessExpenseLoanAgreement2OfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_entity00149655_ContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesRealEstatePfOfContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesRealEstatePfComprehensiveSummaryTableTableOfMember_dart_CategoriesOfBusinessAxis_dart_MaintenanceBusinessMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OriginalPFMember_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_entity00149655_Seoul2OfGeographicalAreasMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 이러한 약정에 따른 조합사업경비 대여 시 일부를 금융기관 대출을 주선하여 간접 조달하고 있으며, 조합이 수령한 주택금융에 대해 관련 금융기관과의 업무협약에 따라 보증금액(위 표 '보증한도' 참조)을 한도(조합대출 잔액 위 표 '대출잔액' 참조)로 연대보증 및 연대상환 책임을 부담하고 있습니다.</entity00149655:ExplanationOfRedevelopmentAndReconstructionAssociationsBusinessExpenseLoanAgreement2OfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems>
